en:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0040010a15'>
//「御父、もういかぬ！
//　敵兵の数は百や二百ではない」
"There's nothing more we can do, Father! The enemy is thousands strong!"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0040020a15'>
//「このままでは皆殺しぞ！」
"If we stay, we shall all perish!"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040030b30'>
//「……おのれ……」
"How..."

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0040040a01'>
//「母様、怪我……！」
"Mother, you're hurt!"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0040050a15'>
//「構うでない。
//　流れ矢が掠めただけだ」
"Leave it. A scratch from a stray arrow will not kill me."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0040060a15'>
//「母より自分の心配をせよ。
//　焼けて崩れた家の下敷きにでもなろうもの
//なら、助からぬぞ」
"Look to your own safety instead. If you get trapped under a house, that's the end of you."

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0040070a01'>
//「う、うん……」
"R- Right..."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0040080a15'>
//「御父、とにかく今は<RUBY text='ひ'>退</RUBY>こう。
//　裏里まで逃れれば、奴らも追って来られぬ」
"Father, we must be gone from this place. Once we reach the hidden village, the enemy will have to turn <br>back."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040090b30'>
//「……」
"......"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0040100a15'>
//「御父！」
"Father!"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040110b30'>
//「……何故だ。
//　北朝の軍がここまで攻め入って来るなど、
//有り得んことだ！」
"...How could this happen!? We were supposed to be safe from the North!"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040120b30'>
//「こんな筈では……」
"This cannot be..."

//【浦夢】
<voice name='浦夢' class='浦夢' src='voice/md01/0040130b16'>
//「長島を越えない限り、北朝はここまで来れ
//ない……ですか？」
"I assume any invading army would have to pass through Nagashima first?"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040140b30'>
//「浦夢殿……」
"Uramu..."

//【浦夢】
<voice name='浦夢' class='浦夢' src='voice/md01/0040150b16'>
//「では、長島は落ちたのでしょう」
"Then Nagashima must have fallen."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040160b30'>
//「馬鹿な！
//　今、長島を預かるのは他ならぬ飽間様ぞ」
"Impossible! Nagashima is guarded by Lord Akima himself!"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040170b30'>
//「あの方なら、たとえ万の大軍を敵としても
//数日は持ち堪える筈……」
"A general of his caliber could hold that pass for days, even against an army a hundred thousand strong!"

//【浦夢】
<voice name='浦夢' class='浦夢' src='voice/md01/0040180b16'>
//「戦えば、そうでしょう。
//　けれど、戦わなければ、どうですか？」
"Yes, if he indeed defended his castle. But what if he did not?"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040190b30'>
//「な、何!?」
"What!?"

//【浦夢】
<voice name='浦夢' class='浦夢' src='voice/md01/0040200b16'>
//「飽間どのが北朝の軍勢を素通しにしたなら
//……」
"If Lord Akima let the enemy pass unhindered..."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040210b30'>
//「戯けたことを申すな!!」
"How can you say such a thing!?"

//【浦夢】
<voice name='浦夢' class='浦夢' src='voice/md01/0040220b16'>
///「……」
"......"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040230b30'>
//「確かに当世、武人といえばどいつも達磨よ。
//　<RUBY text='あっち'>北朝</RUBY>へ転がり<RUBY text='こっち'>南朝</RUBY>へ転がり、風向き次第で
//旗幟を変えよる」
"Yes, many in this age sell their swords cheaply, changing their allegiance as a snake changes its skin." 

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040240b30'>
//「だが飽間様は違うっ！
//　あの方は、」
"But not him! Lord Akima is different!"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040250b30'>
//「……あの方だけは……」
"He would never..."

//【浦夢】
<voice name='浦夢' class='浦夢' src='voice/md01/0040260b16'>
//「村正どの……」
"Muramasa..."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0040270a15'>
//「……御父。
//　今は考えまい」
"...Father. Now is not the time for this."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0040280a15'>
//「今は逃げねばならぬ。
///　忘れたか。御父は大和一の劒冑を打てと、
//先の帝より勅を賜った身」
"We must flee. Or have you forgotten your duty? You were commissioned by the emperor himself to forge the mightiest tsurugi in Yamato."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0040290a15'>
//「ここで命を危うくしてはならぬ！」
"Your life is not yours to risk here!"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0040300a01'>
//「爺様」
"Grandfather."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0040310b30'>
//「……くっ」
"...Kuh!"
